{
  "name": "dsh-plain-approval",
  "version": "0.7.5",
  "description": "说人话 —— 让每一条提权命令，都先说人话。DSH 审批卡片「意图」解释插件。v0.7.0 卡片重构：标题置顶、风险与建议合并一行、细节全部折叠；风险判定改由本地规则给出（模型只负责说人话），提示词砍掉 55%、字段从 8 个减到 5 个；上下文新增 AI 思考过程（reasoning）并可一键关闭。",
  "type": "module",
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": "dsh-plain-approval contributors",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "plugin",
    "approval",
    "permission",
    "ollama",
    "plain-language",
    "chinese"
  ],
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./client": "./client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "client.js",
    "src",
    "assets",
    "locale",
    "icon.svg",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "CHANGELOG.md",
    "修复说明-v0.4.6-safe.md",
    "升级指南-v0.5.0-stable.md",
    "发布清单-v0.5.1.md",
    "NOTICE",
    "SECURITY.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=22.5.0"
  },
  "icon": "./icon.svg",
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "immediately": true,
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-conversation",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-approval"
      ]
    }
  }
}
